@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Live Tracking Bus Pariwisata

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  ActorBorderColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #777777
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  ParticipantBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DatabaseBorderColor #333333
  DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BoxBorderColor #999999
}

actor "Admin PO" as Admin
actor "Driver" as Driver
participant "Frontend Admin\n(Vue Dashboard)" as FEAdmin
participant "Frontend Driver\n(Aplikasi Driver)" as FEDriver
participant "AuthService" as AuthService
participant "Laravel API" as API
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "TripController" as TripController
database "Database\n(MySQL)" as DB
participant "Broadcast Event\nTripPositionUpdated" as Event
participant "Laravel Echo /\nRealtime Channel" as Echo
participant "Leaflet Map /\nOpenStreetMap" as Map

== Autentikasi Admin ==
Admin -> FEAdmin: Membuka halaman login
FEAdmin -> AuthService: Kirim email, password, portal internal
AuthService -> API: POST /auth/login
API -> AuthController: login(request)
AuthController -> DB: Validasi user dan role
DB --> AuthController: Data user admin

alt Kredensial valid dan role admin
  AuthController -> AuthController: Buat token Sanctum\nability: admin
  AuthController --> API: Token dan data user
  API --> AuthService: Response login berhasil
  AuthService --> FEAdmin: Simpan token dan role admin
  FEAdmin --> Admin: Arahkan ke dashboard
else Kredensial tidak valid / role tidak sesuai
  AuthController --> API: Response error
  API --> AuthService: Login gagal
  AuthService --> FEAdmin: Tampilkan pesan kesalahan
  FEAdmin --> Admin: Login ditolak
end

== Admin Membuka Live Tracking ==
Admin -> FEAdmin: Pilih menu Live Tracking
FEAdmin -> API: GET /planned-trips/on-route\nBearer token admin
API -> TripController: getOnRouteTrips()
TripController -> DB: Ambil planned trip berstatus running\nbeserta driver, bus, route, posisi terakhir
DB --> TripController: Data perjalanan aktif
TripController --> API: Daftar running trips
API --> FEAdmin: Response running trips
FEAdmin -> Echo: Subscribe channel setiap trip aktif
FEAdmin -> Map: Tampilkan marker bus\nberdasarkan last_position_lat/lng
Map --> Admin: Peta live tracking tampil

== Driver Memulai Perjalanan ==
Driver -> FEDriver: Tekan tombol mulai perjalanan
FEDriver -> API: POST /planned-trips/start-stop\nplanned_trip_id, mode=1
API -> TripController: startStopPlannedTrip(request)
TripController -> DB: Validasi trip dan driver
DB --> TripController: Data planned trip

alt Driver sesuai dan trip belum dimulai
  TripController -> DB: Update started_at
  DB --> TripController: Status perjalanan tersimpan
  TripController --> API: Response success
  API --> FEDriver: Perjalanan aktif
else Driver tidak sesuai / trip tidak valid
  TripController --> API: Response error
  API --> FEDriver: Tampilkan pesan gagal
end

== Pengiriman Posisi GPS ==
loop Setiap interval GPS driver
  FEDriver -> API: POST /planned-trips/set-last-position\nplanned_trip_id, lat, lng, speed
  API -> TripController: setLastPosition(request)
  TripController -> DB: Validasi planned trip dan driver
  DB --> TripController: Data planned trip aktif

  alt Trip aktif dan driver berwenang
    TripController -> DB: Update last_position_lat\nlast_position_lng
    DB --> TripController: Posisi terakhir tersimpan
    TripController -> Event: broadcast(channel, lat, lng, speed)
    Event -> Echo: Publish TripPositionUpdated
    Echo -> FEAdmin: Kirim data posisi terbaru
    FEAdmin -> Map: Perbarui marker bus dan info speed
    Map --> Admin: Lokasi bus bergerak di dashboard
    TripController -> DB: Cek stop berikutnya,\npenumpang pickup/drop-off,\ndan jarak ke halte
    DB --> TripController: Data operasional perjalanan
    TripController --> API: Response success dan info next_stop
    API --> FEDriver: Informasi stop berikutnya
  else Trip belum aktif / sudah selesai / tidak berwenang
    TripController --> API: Response error
    API --> FEDriver: Tampilkan pesan gagal kirim lokasi
  end
end

== Polling Cadangan Dashboard ==
loop Setiap 10 detik
  FEAdmin -> API: GET /planned-trips/on-route\nBearer token admin
  API -> TripController: getOnRouteTrips()
  TripController -> DB: Ambil posisi terakhir running trips
  DB --> TripController: Data posisi terbaru
  TripController --> API: Daftar running trips
  API --> FEAdmin: Response posisi terbaru
  FEAdmin -> Map: Sinkronisasi marker jika realtime terlambat
end

== Driver Mengakhiri Perjalanan ==
Driver -> FEDriver: Tekan tombol selesai perjalanan
FEDriver -> API: POST /planned-trips/start-stop\nplanned_trip_id, mode=0
API -> TripController: startStopPlannedTrip(request)
TripController -> DB: Validasi trip aktif dan driver
DB --> TripController: Data planned trip
TripController -> DB: Update ended_at\njika charter, status menjadi completed
DB --> TripController: Perjalanan selesai
TripController --> API: Response success
API --> FEDriver: Perjalanan selesai
FEAdmin -> API: GET /planned-trips/on-route
API --> FEAdmin: Trip tidak lagi masuk running trips
FEAdmin -> Map: Hapus / tidak tampilkan marker bus selesai
Map --> Admin: Dashboard hanya menampilkan trip aktif

@enduml
